[speed=0.7]...Huh?[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Oww... everything hurts...[/speed]

[speed=0.9][wave amp=1 freq=2]...The water![/wave][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Nanay?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Tatay?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.9]Kuya Dodong? Noni? Ate Valerie? Kiki?[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Where is everyone?[/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0][b]Oh, anak! You're awake![/b][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.2][shake rate=16 level=7][b]NANAY![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=10 level=5]I... I was so scared![/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.7]Shhh... I'm here, anak. I'm right here.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4]I thought... I thought I couldn't find you anymore...[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]It's okay. You're safe now.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Where's everyone else?[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]They've been waiting for you to wake up.[/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.2][shake rate=16 level=8][b]KUYA OLLIE![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.2][shake rate=16 level=8][b]NONI![/b][/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.8][shake rate=8 level=4]I thought you were gone! I was scared...[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]...Me too.[/shake][/speed]

KIKI:[speed=0.8]Uya![/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=0.8]Ollie...Thank goodness you're okay.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]ATE! KIKI![/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.9]Took you long enough to wake up, huh?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0][b]KUYA! Don't ruffle my hair like that![/b][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=0.9]Heh. You're still grumpy. That's a good sign.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]...Where's Tatay?[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.7]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...Nay?[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.7]Tatay... hasn't come back yet, anak.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]What do you mean?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=7 level=4]He's still out there?[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.6]We... we don't know yet.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]But he'll come back, right?[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.6]...[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.7]We're still looking for him...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6]...Oh.[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=3]I look around but Tatay isn't here.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]Everyone else is here...[/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=5 level=3]But not him.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=25 level=8][b]I'm sorry, Nay! I-I'm so sorry...I..[/b][/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]It's not your fault, Ollie. You hear me? It's not your fault.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=8 level=4]But I was right there![/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=9 level=4]I was supposed to help him...I was so close...[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=6 level=4]...Can we go look for Tatay, Nay?[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.7]Anak, we have to stay here for now.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=7 level=4]But what if he's looking for us too?[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.6]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]Tatay knows where we're supposed to go, right?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]He'll find us...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=5 level=3]He has to.[/shake][/speed]

=> END